    <string name="app_news_items_v3_7_0">• A lot of work was done to update Mumla for Android 15 and 16 (API 35 &amp; 36).\n
• As a consequence Android 5.0 (API 21) or later is now required.\n
• Theming was modernized to support system light/dark modes.\n
• The settings screen had to be adapted to newer APIs.\n
• Added in-app language preference.\n</string>
    <string name="app_news_items_v3_7_1">• Minor release with mostly translation updates, thank you all translators!\n</string>
    <string name="app_news_items_v3_7_2">• Fix potential crash on startup.\n
• Add some translations, thank you all translators!\n</string>
    <string name="app_news_items_v3_7_3">• Make PTT hot corner visible on Android 12 and later, and on dark and light background\n
• Make the Back-button ask to disconnect from server again on Android 16+\n</string>

